# S0p, hold: a start in IBD whose second block leaves it (BL-969: a restore at T_RECENT loads past
# IBD and arms no LEFT_IBD), so LEFT_IBD freezes mid-op and CACHE_LARGE at the op's end, each
# mirrored to Core; then a KILL after the mirrors.
start hold
start old
extend main 1
warp 30
extend main 1
restart kill
extend main 1
